  "description": {
   "en": "Hinako, a high schooler, is left alone without any relatives to take care of her after she lost her beloved mother.Overcome with sadness, she agrees to be a live-in employee at the handsome CEO Yukihito's house after a series of events.To keep up appearances, Hinako ends up getting married to Yukihito... but he actually has 4 children?!!\n\nA heartfelt story about a couple with a complicated past, along with their children’s strong personalities.\n\n(Source: Gourmet Scans)"
